# FitPower needs no environment variables to run.
#
# - There is no backend and no account: all data stays in your browser
#   (localStorage / IndexedDB) at the address you open the app on.
# - The optional AI coach asks for your own API key inside the app. That key is
#   stored only in your browser, is never part of a backup, and is sent only to
#   the AI provider you choose. Do NOT put an AI key in an env file: anything
#   prefixed with VITE_ is baked into the built JavaScript for anyone to read.
#
# If you add a backend later, copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored).
# Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
